      "value": "Seems to not freeze in certain worlds, example being Infected: Reborn regardless of time spent in said world, unable to reproduce whatever is preventing the freeze anywhere else though. Attempted to see if an alternate account would be free of the bug however my avatar still froze. My partner did log into my account on her headset and she did not freeze up, hopefully this information helps.",
