      "mergeID": "6525613f74fef8b194dea6f2",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Possibly caused by worlds that teleport you.\n\nOther players cannot hear or see you when this happens, you are essentially a ghost with a frozen body in spawn.  They see your avatar frozen with your nametag above and cannot hear you even from the frozen position you are at.  This happens very consistently in certain worlds such as terrors of nowhere, usually within 30 minutes.  This bug is hard to detect from the user's end, as they will only think they are being ignored, a friend noticed me frozen in spawn and messaged me, that is the only reason I knew it was happening.  This bug is fresh since  build 1355.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "client desync/ghost bug",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "651aff10b3fa7a0953a9e3ec",
