      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have been having this issue a lot too. Like.. A LOT.\n\nNo idea what triggers it as often it's fairly random, can have a great time for an hour, then desynch and it then happen multiple times with no variables changing.\n\nOne thing i've noticed is that with almost a 100% guarantee, if i start having that glitch, if i change size or change avatar, it triggers it.\n\nOverall it make the game give me an headache to play as i have to constantly interact with other like a clingy person, just to see if im there or not.\n\nI spend over 50+ times rejoining instances for just a few hours of gameplay so i hope it get resolved soon !\n\n( I play on Quest 2 pcvr, having this issue on both latest update and beta update. )",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
