  "details": "Unclear how to reproduce, other than to stay in an instance for a very long session.\n\nRandomly, other players will see me as frozen in place, and hear my voice coming from my frozen avatar, regardless of my actual location. Rejoining the instance seems to fix the issue for a while.\n\nNot everybody sees me as frozen, though. Some players can see me moving around just fine. It's led to some awkward interactions until people realize what's going on.",
